	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat780010a"},
		line=1961,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"On a day when I'm not needed at the Sworn Blades, Akari and I are helping out at Koujiya Flowers.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Without any deliveries scheduled, our job is to simply watch over the shop.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Pacing about the storefront, Akari lets out a big stretch in the early summer sun.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It sure is getting hot.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, that's it! With weather like this, there's only one food that comes to mind!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Chilled tofu?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Tofu-for-brains.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Akari heaves a deep sigh, rolling her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm talking about shaved ice, genius.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I didn't ever get the chance to eat it in Iseya, so I've been really craving it.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The sound of an approaching military vehicle interrupts our conversation.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The thundering of its heavy wheels rumbles deep in my stomach as it pulls to a stop right in front of us.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What'd you do this time?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, I didn't do anything!”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"The backseat door swings open.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Akari blinks her eyes wide upon seeing the unlikely pair that steps out of the vehicle.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"There's a good chance I have the exact same look on my own face.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's quite the reaction.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"One half of the duo, Elsa, retorts as she brushes her beautiful blonde hair behind her shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"She fixes Akari and me with a stern glare, her hands on her hips.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What, am I not allowed to patronize your humble flower shop?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are, it's just...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"I glance at the person cowering at Elsa's side.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"She's practically shrinking into herself, her face as pale as a sheet.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ina-san, are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Y-Yes. Thank you very much... ahaha.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Elsa gives Koyuzu a few gentle pats on the back.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Koyuzu stiffly contorts her face into a smile.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"As soon as we make eye contact, she awkwardly averts her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My men mistook Ina-san for a warrior and pointed their guns at her.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Understandably, she's a little shaken.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mistook her for a warrior?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Koyuzu is, in fact, a bona fide warrior.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“P-Please, it was wholly my fault for acting suspiciously.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sorry for scaring you, dear.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Elsa murmurs apologetically, patting Koyuzu on the head.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Koyuzu directs me and Akari a meaningful look.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"She wants us to play along.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I thought the least I could do was give her a ride home.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“She said she had business here, so this is where I took her, but...”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ina-san, did you want to get yourself some flowers?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"At Elsa's probing question, Koyuzu immediately stiffens her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"She looks to us for assistance.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Um, is the bouquet I ordered ready yet?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I don't recall having received an order from Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"But I see how it is.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Sorry, ma'am, we're still working on it.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I-I see, that's good.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Koyuzu breathes a sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's good?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah?! No, it's not!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Koyuzu snaps to attention with a jolt.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ina-san, there's no need to be so nervous.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Though I suppose that's easier said than done.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“No, not at all...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's quite all right. No need to force yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Elsa shows her a considerate smile.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I think I'm getting a vague idea of what happened.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Koyuzu must have been apprehended in the middle of a reconnaissance operation.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"And in order to avoid suspicion, she made up a story about having business at the shop.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"With the expectation that Akari and I would be able to corroborate her story.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Seemingly also realizing what's going on, Akari directs a small nod at me as she meets my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Our first order of business should be getting Elsa out of here without arousing her suspicion.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Um, Elsa-san, thank you for bringing me all the way here.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Koyuzu's trying to wrap things up with Elsa as well.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"She bows her head to Elsa, mindful of the cloth package clutched in her hands.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"In all likelihood, her spellblade is concealed inside.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"If Elsa were to find it, it'd end badly for us.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No need to apologize. We were the ones in the wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I know! Tokita-kun, since I'm here already, would you mind arranging some flowers for me as well?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"The color slowly drains from Koyuzu's face.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Seems like we're not out of the woods just yet.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you want them right away?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, there's no rush. As long as you can have them ready in around a week from now.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Would you mind delivering them, though? Just bring them straight to the Government-General.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure thing. What's the occasion?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Throwing a ≪party≫ for a friend of mine. Mind if I pick out the flowers right now?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Elsa begins looking over the flowers in the shop.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm, I have no idea where to even start...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ina-san, would you mind giving me a hand?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hweh?!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Koyuzu practically leaps off the ground in shock.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“C'mon, right this way.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“E-Elsa-san...”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Elsa grabs Koyuzu's hand and halfway drags her into the shop.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"She looks at me with panicked eyes, but there's nothing I can do about it.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Is this really gonna be okay?)”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(It'll be fine. Just act natural.)”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Akari whispers to me as she anxiously watches Elsa and Koyuzu wander deeper into the shop.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Meanwhile, Elsa talks animatedly to Koyuzu while looking over some hydrangeas.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My, don't you think these would look good on you?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I-If you say so...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“But I believe these flowers would look good on you, Elsa-san.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Koyuzu points at a lily with strikingly white petals.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehee. Why, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Elsa flashes her a kindly smile, reaching over to pat her on the head.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Akari watches the scene before her in amazement.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say, do you happen to like kids?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No, not particularly.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But I am very fond of Ina-san. She's such a cutie.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...I'm not a kid.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Akari and Elsa seemingly don't manage to hear Koyuzu's disgruntled muttering.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Suddenly, the blade hanging from Elsa's waist catches my eye.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Unlike the standard-issue combat knives of the Republican Army, both its hilt and sheath are finely decorated.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"It looks more like a spellblade than anything else, though I\ncan't be sure.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Koyuzu also seems to be fixated on it, repeatedly stealing glances at it whenever Elsa is distracted.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"After ten long minutes have passed, Elsa finally finishes picking out her flowers.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Fortunately, she doesn't seem to suspect a thing out of Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Until next time, Ina-san.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Y-Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Elsa cheerfully waves her goodbye, and Koyuzu returns her a strained smile.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Paying it no mind, Elsa climbs into the backseat of the vehicle she arrived in.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"None of us take our eyes off the vehicle until it leaves our sight.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Only then does Akari let out a sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, what happened?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...I failed in my tailing operation.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"She groans dejectedly.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"She must've encountered some truly extenuating circumstances for her to fail her mission.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Her track record more than testifies to her abilities.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Almost all of the intelligence the Sworn Blades have gathered is owed to Koyuzu's undercover operations.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What happened?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Um...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Koyuzu stammers hesitantly.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's take this somewhere else.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, head up to my room. It's right upstairs.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Koyuzu totters unsteadily up the staircase.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Koyuzu looks pretty down on herself... Is she okay?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hard to say.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I'm not that close to Koyuzu, so it's hard for me to get a read on her.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"At any rate, let's hear what she has to say.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"When I enter my room, I find Koyuzu sitting curled up into a ball on the tatami.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“What a disgrace.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“My failure very nearly caused a tremendous amount of trouble for the Sworn Blades and Hotori-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“And on top of that, I allowed my mortal enemy to pat me on the head...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"From the bound cloth at Koyuzu's side peeks out her spellblade ",
{"ruby", text="Fledgling Fox"},
"Kogitsunemaru.",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Drink this and settle yourself down.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I pour her a cup of hot tea and set it down on the table.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Looking up at me with wavering eyes, Koyuzu reaches for the teacup.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Fwooh, fwooh, fwooh...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Bad with hot drinks?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“O-Of course not.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Fwooh, fwooh, fwooh...”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"She immediately denies it, but she still continues blowing on her tea for some time.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Once cooled to her satisifaction, she begins carefully lapping at it like a kitten.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...Phew.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Seeming to have calmed down, Koyuzu lets out a relaxed sigh.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It looked like you were tailing Elsa. A mission for the Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes. We received a report of Elsa wandering around the neighborhood.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“One of our arsenals is rather close by, so I was tracking her just to be safe.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“As it turns out, she was just on an ordinary patrol, though.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"She must have gotten caught in the process.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How'd Elsa manage to catch you?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Did you happen to notice the spellblade that Elsa was carrying on her person?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"So that was a spellblade after all.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I nod, but Koyuzu averts her gaze before continuing in a hesitant voice.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“As a matter of fact, that is the prized heirloom of House Ina.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I have been told that it was bestowed upon the forebears of House Ina by a past Emperor.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So you got caught in the process of trying to retrieve it?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I have no excuses.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“When I witnessed my family's heirloom being treated like a plaything, I was simply unable to bear it.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You did lose your family in the war.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes. I am the sole surviving member of House Ina.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Her family heirloom, huh?",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Having no memories of my own family, I'm unable to truly understand just how important it must be to Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"But from the look on her face, I can imagine well enough.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know Elsa's been collecting spellblades, but why is she carrying one on her person?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Only a warrior should be able to activate its powers.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“It is possible that she thinks of it as nothing more than an ornament.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At any rate, at least you didn't get shot.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Right...”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Though I deserved no less for being apprehended in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I am terribly sorry! I even dragged you into my mess...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Koyuzu buries her face between her legs.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"She's just like a child trying to hide her tears.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I am a failure of a warrior for being so weak-willed...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You have nothing to be ashamed of.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“What? Because I'm immature as a warrior?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"She suddenly lashes out at me.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"This isn't the first time Koyuzu has taken this attitude with me.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I didn't mean it that way.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You say some harsh things sometimes. Did I offend you somehow?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You would never understand.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"She turns away in a huff.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“At any rate, I will forget all about that spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you really okay with relinquishing your family's heirloom?”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Koyuzu bites down on her quivering lip.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I have already violated the Sworn Blades' by-laws with my indiscretion.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why don't you talk to Hotori about this first?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think she'd be willing to help you out.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“She would never. That spellblade may be a family heirloom, but its abilities are nothing special.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“It would by no means be worth the risk to retrieve.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"She seems to be trying to convince herself as much as me.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you asked her as a friend, I'm sure she'd hear you out.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama is the warriors' Executor. She would never be willing to ignore the by-laws just for me.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Even if she were, I could never accept that.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"It's probably a sign of just how much Koyuzu respects her, but I think the way she imagines Hotori is a bit too uncompromising.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Please forget everything I told you about that spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Everything Koyuzu says is correct.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"It is certainly not wise to risk so much just to retrieve a single spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"But at the same time, it is an unimaginable indignity to be forced to watch as your family's prized heirloom is carried away by the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I'm sure that Hotori will also be able to sympathize.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Taking out my cell phone, I make the call.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's up?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori?”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hey, Tokita-san?!”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Is Koyuzu there with you?”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Realizing that Koyuzu is within earshot, Hotori immediately changes her tone.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Ignoring Koyuzu's flustered protests, I continue my call.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have you already heard about Koyuzu's situation?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I know the gist of it.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa was wearing House Ina's spellblade. For Koyuzu, it's a memento of her late family.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu wants to take it back. Should I stop her?”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Is that why she failed her reconnaissance operation?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Apparently.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah! Wh-What are you saying?!”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Take this! And this!”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"She claws at me, but I deftly brush her aside.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...What are you doing?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu's trying to mess with me.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Mmmmmmrgh...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Kogitsunemaru!",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wha─?!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Koyuzu draws her spellblade, immediately sprouting fox ears and a tail.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Kogitsunemaru has the effect of hiding its wielder from the perception of others.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"The moment she draws it, I become unable to predict her next move.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"At any rate, I definitely won't be able to fend her off with only one hand.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yaah!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Koyuzu leaps onto my back, wrapping her arms around my neck from behind.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Dangling from my neck, she brings her face right up to the cell phone at my ear.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Our bodies are pressed together and our faces are nearly touching, but she doesn't even seem to notice.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“P-Please forgive me, Hotori-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“This has nothing to do with the Sworn Blades! Please forget all about it!”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Permission granted.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You are permitted to go retrieve that spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Koyuzu's eyes go wide at the voice coming from my cell phone.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"Even though that was the response I expected all along.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Now, Koyuzu will be able to reclaim her family's spellblade without violating any of our by-laws.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Will she be able to request assistance from the other warriors?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"I can't see her face, but I can tell that Hotori is frowning to herself on the other side of the call.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"At the end of the day, this is still Koyuzu's personal issue.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"She can't possibly justify sparing personnel for a matter wholly unrelated to the Blades.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"And naturally, as our chairman, Hotori herself is no exception.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Tokita, can I task you with overseeing Koyuzu's actions as the inspector general?”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"I immediately grasp Hotori's intention.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"To mount a retrieval operation for Koyuzu's spellblade while devoting the least amount of manpower necessary, it makes the most sense to send me alone to help her.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Truthfully, I wish I could be of more help...”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry about it. The chairman has more important things to focus on.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, thanks for understanding.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Also, Koyuzu?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Y-Yes ma'am?!”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Next time, tell me everything from the start.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"With that, Hotori hangs up the call.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...I never thought she would grant her permission.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori isn't the hard-headed chairman you imagine her as.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You should try speaking your mind to her more often.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Wh-Why, I would never call Hotori-sama hard-headed!”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“And Tokita-san, did you intend to tell Hotori-sama everything from the very... huh?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"It seems like Koyuzu's finally realized just how close our faces are.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Her breath tickles my lips.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"In the blink of an eye, Koyuzu's cheeks flush a bright red.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah, uhh, aaah! T-Too close!”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"She flails wildly, kicking me with her dangling legs.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin! What's all the ruckus?!”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Akari slides the door open with a bang, poking her unamused face into the room.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"From her point of view, Koyuzu and I are clearly embracing each other.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So you like 'em like Koyuzu, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No wonder you never even spared me or Inou a second glance... ahaha...”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"Akari chuckles darkly to herself, slowly sliding the door shut.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san?!”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You're wrong! It's not what it looks like!”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“First off, how about you get off of me?”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah, you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Koyuzu lets go of me, tumbling back to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"She immediately turns away, trying to hide her crimson expression.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It all worked out, didn't it? You got your permission.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll also lend you a hand. It's looking likely that you'll be able to get your spellblade back.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“No, I couldn't possibly get you involved.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Chairman's orders.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Haah... True enough, we dare not disobey Hotori-sama's orders.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Koyuzu murmurs with a resigned expression.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"However, she soon turns to me with a meaningful look, her fingers hesitantly interlaced in front of her chest.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Um, thank you for telling Hotori-sama about my spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“If you hadn't said anything, I would have given up all hope.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All I did was make a phone call.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By the way, how about you come along to Miyoshi tonight?”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I want to consult with Hotori about how best to retrieve the spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes, I shall certainly attend.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“But first, should we not clear up Miyaguni-san's misunderstanding?”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"Koyuzu looks nervously towards the door to my room.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...You've got a point there.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san, you are rather careless for being the inspector general.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"Koyuzu giggles to herself.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"It's pretty rare for Koyuzu to let down her guard like this in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"But the sight of her innocent, childlike smile never fails to bring a smile to my own face.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"The two of us proceed to leave the room together and clear up Akari's misunderstanding.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"That night, our party of four gathers at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Akari, Hotori, Koyuzu and I are sitting at a low table in the tatami room.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"I was fortunately able to clear my good name of any suspicions of perverse prepubescent paraphilia, and I proceeded to bring Akari up to speed about House Ina's spellblade.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"After a few bites of the food we're brought, Hotori opens her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So it looks like the big question is how we're going to get that spellblade back from Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'm terribly sorry for troubling you, Hotori-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No need to apologize.”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Augh!”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"Hotori pokes Koyuzu on the forehead with her finger.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"Still holding Koyuzu's forehead back, Hotori looks at her with a kindly expression.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So, did you manage to gather any useful intel?”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"Koyuzu's expression immediately turns serious.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"Once we split up at the shop, Koyuzu went off to gather intel.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“It would appear that Elsa is carrying the spellblade on her person at all times.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“She must be quite fond of her new plaything.”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's no way she'd even bring it with her in the bath, right?”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Any bath Elsa takes will be in the Government-General. Sneaking into there would be too risky.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“If only I were able to accomplish that.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, my skills are still too lacking...”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"Koyuzu murmurs apologetically, shrinking into herself.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You do perfectly good work.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...Th-Thank you very much.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			{
"She awkwardly thanks me without making eye contact.",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"Hotori smiles wryly to herself upon seeing our exchange.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu won't be happy with your praise unless you also pat her on the head.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“H-Hotori-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"Koyuzu flushes bright red at Hotori's light-hearted ribbing.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll keep it in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"Taking Hotori's advice, I lay my hand on top of Koyuzu's head.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Stop it, Tokita-san. That tickles.”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"Though she halfway reaches to brush my hand away, she\ndoesn't follow through with it.",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, she's blushing.”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“No, I am certainly not!”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Um, back to the topic of the spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			{
"Koyuzu finally brushes my hand off with a sullen scowl.",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmm, where else might Elsa take off the spellblade besides her own room?”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, I know!”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wouldn't she take it off at school?”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're about to start up swimming classes soon, right?”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even she wouldn't go as far as to wear a blade when she's in her swimsuit.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I believe I should be able to successfully infiltrate the academy.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Though there will be many bystanders, security is not nearly as tight as in the Government-General.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Speaking of, where would Elsa get changed in the first place?”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The student council office. Nobody but her and the other council members can get in there.”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You sure know your stuff.”",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The reason Soujin and I enrolled in the first place was to get a read on Elsa's movements.”",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have a solid grasp on all her habits.”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, I never knew.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In order to fight, you must first know your enemy.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			{
"It was Kokuan-dono who pushed us to enroll in the academy after the war.",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			{
"Part of our goal was to monitor Elsa's movements, but we were also under orders to learn how the Republicans think.",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, we should try to create an opening for Koyuzu to infiltrate the sudent council office.”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Once there, she'll be able to switch the real blade with a fake one.”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why? Can't we just steal it?”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If her spellblade gets stolen, don't you think she'll immediately suspect the warriors?”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But if we switch it for a really realistic replica, I doubt\nshe'll be able to tell the difference.”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“True, only warriors or priestesses would be able to ascertain the authenticity of a spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			{
"If all goes well, Elsa will continue wearing the blade around, being none the wiser.",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you say, Koyuzu? Think you can manage it?”",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'll try my best.”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			{
"Koyuzu nods with determination.",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We still have some time before swimming lessons begin.”",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, just around two weeks.”",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"It's not long at all, but it's still better than nothing.",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, would I be able to use Kogitsunemaru, too?”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Kogitsunemaru?”",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes, I believe you would...”",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"Koyuzu looks at me with a dubious expression.",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			{
"Kogitsunemaru is Koyuzu's spellblade of choice.",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			{
"It is able to sharpen its wielder's senses, enhance their agility, and allow them to meld away into the background.",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"The perfect spellblade for covert operations.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, will you teach me how to use Kogitsunemaru?”",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Huh? Why Kogitsunemaru?”",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			{
"Koyuzu cocks her head quizzically.",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's no guarantee the operation will go according to plan.”",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If anything happens, I might need to be able to take your place.”",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"Of course, I probably won't be able to get too far with only two weeks to train.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			{
"But still, it's better than doing nothing.",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Better to be safe than sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, why don't you give him some training?”",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			{
"Koyuzu doesn't seem particularly resistant once Hotori offers me her support.",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Hehee.”",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're gonna use Kogitsunemaru, that means you'll also grow fox ears and a tail, right?”",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, I suppose so.”",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			{
"A unique feature of Kogitsunemaru is that its wielder will grow the ears and tail of a fox.",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry, I started imagining it a little, and... pfft...”",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			{
"She lets out another amused giggle.",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			{
"I try imagining it as well, but I fail to see what's so funny.",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Pfft...”",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you just laugh?”",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“No, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			{
"She was definitely doubled over in laughter a second ago, but she feigns ignorance, looking at me with a perfectly straight face.",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say, would I be able to use Kogitsunemaru as well?”",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes, as long as you're capable of activating spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“But I have been told that if it is not Honed regularly, it will induce terrible side effects...”",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			{
"Akari and Koyuzu continue their conversation.",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			{
"As they do, Hotori leans in close to whisper in my ear.",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks for telling me about the spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If it wasn't for you, I think Koyuzu would've kept quiet and given up.”",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hardly did anything.”",
			},
		},
		[408]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Also, it's nice to see the two of you getting along.”",
			},
		},
		[409]={
			{
"Hotori steals a sideways glance at Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[410]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu usually tends to avoid you, doesn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[411]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You noticed that?”",
			},
		},
		[412]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" the chairman, y'know.”",
			},
		},
		[413]={
			{
"Hotori smiles jokingly.",
			},
		},
		[414]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She looked awfully happy when you petted her earlier, too.”",
			},
		},
		[415]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wasn't she annoyed?”",
			},
		},
		[416]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She was just acting shy. Koyuzu's really fond of being doted on like that.”",
			},
		},
		[417]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I hope she gets more and more comfortable with depending on you.”",
			},
		},
		[418]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I doubt that. She's only got eyes for you.”",
			},
		},
		[419]={
			{
"Hotori rolls her eyes at my attempt at a joke.",
			},
		},
		[420]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No way. She's never honest with herself in front of me.”",
			},
		},
		[421]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Though, I am happy that she looks up to me.”",
			},
		},
		[422]={
			{
"Koyuzu respects Hotori more than anyone else in the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[423]={
			{
"That's why Hotori is the last person she would show weakness to.",
			},
		},
		[424]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu's been lonely ever since she lost her family.”",
			},
		},
		[425]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What she really needs isn't a memento of her family, but someone who can take their place.”",
			},
		},
		[426]={
			{
"Hotori whispers softly, more to herself than to me.",
			},
		},
		[427]={
			{
"Someone to replace her family, huh?",
			},
		},
		[428]={
			{
"Considering that I have no memories whatsoever of my own family, I doubt I'd be suited for that task.",
			},
		},
		[429]={
			{
"Besides, Koyuzu always avoids opening up to me.",
			},
		},
		[430]={
			{
"I think back to our conversation at the flower shop.",
			},
		},
		[431]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I didn't mean it that way.”",
			},
		},
		[432]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You say some harsh things sometimes. Did I offend you somehow?”",
			},
		},
		[433]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You would never understand.”",
			},
		},
		[434]={
			{
"Even after thinking about it some more, I'm still unable to figure out what she meant.",
			},
		},
